{"id":"635428","name":"豌豆凉粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/635428/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豌豆粉","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"凉水","amount":"7碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好一碗豌豆粉。","img":"images/635428/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加一碗水调匀，搅拌均匀至无干粉。","img":"images/635428/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧水，锅中加入6碗水，大火烧开。","img":"images/635428/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开后，慢慢倒入调好的豌豆粉水，不停的搅拌，以免糊底。","img":"images/635428/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"不停的搅拌。","img":"images/635428/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"待冒小泡泡时，就好了。","img":"images/635428/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入模具中，室温晾凉2个小时以上。","img":"images/635428/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"晾凉后，倒扣出来，切成小方块。","img":"images/635428/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用冰水泡一下。","img":"images/635428/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛入碗中，加入蜂蜜即可食用。","img":"images/635428/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"冰冰凉凉的，不错！","img":"images/635428/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}